ee `b0d6078a1e9f9b7ed0e39b1fd60d00d06f987451`. Final verification and evidence admission remain **in progress**. Independent Controller verification remains pending. This PR stays **Draft / Open / Unmerged**.\n\nImplementation and verification boundaries are recorded in the [published engineering handoff](https://github.com/Corwin-Code/marketops-platform/blob/a5a308cfbd593ec4f345bfd5c35767683db6c7b1/docs/07-phase-evidence/SLICE-V1-003/rework-r1/final-gate-r1/CURRENT-ENGINEERING-HANDOFF.md).\n\n`production_write_enabled=false`. The 24 release obligations retain their production boundary. Publication is append-only on the named branch. Ready, merge, force-push, real Provider access and shared/production operations remain outside this work.\n","created_at":"2026-09-05T10:24:22Z","updated_at":"2026-09-06T17:22:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f9fe2f58f23327b5ffa0ff755a2f392fc7a3215e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Corwin-Code/marketops-platform/pulls/30/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Corwin-Code/marketops-platform/pulls/30/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Corwin-Code/marketops-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Corwin-Code/marketops-platform/issues/30/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Corwin-Code/marketops-platform/statuses/32b307c648d16f2ecb7f0074e615e78e95ed4121","head":{"label":"Corwin-Code:feat/SLICE-V1-003-advertising-traffic-efficiency","ref":"feat/SLICE-V1-003-advertising-traffic-efficiency","sha":"32b307c648d16f2ecb7f0074e615e78e95ed4121","user":{"login":"Corwin-Code","id":219115063,"node_id":"U_kgDODQ9uNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219115063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corwin-Code","html_url":"https://github.com/Corwin-Code","followers_url":"ht